02:28:58,640 --> 02:29:01,920
Right, and she said she wanted to eat yakiniku!

2023
02:29:01,920 --> 02:29:05,700
Wow, that's so sweet of you!

2024
02:29:05,780 --> 02:29:10,440
It's funny how Nibu-chan says I'm cute.

2025
02:29:10,440 --> 02:29:15,220
Thank you. Are you coming too, Nibu?

2026
02:29:15,780 --> 02:29:19,960
Put the rice cooker away.

2027
02:29:19,960 --> 02:29:23,400
This? He gestured to everything.

2028
02:29:23,400 --> 02:29:27,296
I know...

2029
02:29:27,296 --> 02:29:31,576
I'd like to clean up a bit.

2030
02:29:33,056 --> 02:29:37,576
It's like I'm in a dream.

2031
02:29:39,256 --> 02:29:41,496
Well...

2032
02:29:42,016 --> 02:29:49,976
But... the angle of view on this feed is surprisingly beautiful.

2033
02:29:49,976 --> 02:29:52,896
How about this?

2034
02:29:54,216 --> 02:29:57,136
50 more to go!

2035
02:29:57,296 --> 02:30:00,096
Awww!

2036
02:30:00,826 --> 02:30:03,826
Well then...

2037
02:30:04,946 --> 02:30:12,146
Well, I'm sleepy myself, but...

2038
02:30:12,146 --> 02:30:19,706
I'm sure you're all getting sleepy too.

2039
02:30:19,826 --> 02:30:22,026
You know...

2040
02:30:22,026 --> 02:30:29,792
I can't believe that 31,000 people have viewed the site even at this hour.

2041
02:30:29,792 --> 02:30:42,632
Thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you.

2042
02:30:42,632 --> 02:30:54,032
I'm pretty touched that you're watching me, and I'm not sure if it's okay that you're watching me.

2043
02:30:54,032 --> 02:30:59,888
I'd like to say thank you at the end, so...

2044
02:30:59,888 --> 02:31:01,888
Can I play it for you?

2045
02:31:05,128 --> 02:31:07,488
This is my favorite song.

2046
02:31:09,208 --> 02:31:11,208
Well...

2047
02:31:11,208 --> 02:31:17,088
Yes, Takahashi Mikuji requested this song Sankisei

2048
02:31:18,488 --> 02:31:20,488
Yes, yes, yes

2049
02:31:23,488 --> 02:31:27,048
He said he'd like to hear this song if it's hard to play

2050
02:31:29,664 --> 02:31:36,344
I like it too, and I think a lot of people like it

2051
02:31:40,026 --> 02:31:42,026
One time

2052
02:31:45,786 --> 02:31:47,786
Okay, let's go

2053
02:31:47,786 --> 02:31:49,786
Here we go.

2054
02:31:51,786 --> 02:31:53,786
All of you.

2055
02:31:53,786 --> 02:31:55,786
Thank you.

2056
02:31:55,786 --> 02:31:57,786
Here we go.

2057
02:31:57,786 --> 02:31:59,786
One moment.

2058
02:32:08,186 --> 02:32:14,506
Now please listen. If silence is love.

2059
02:32:19,610 --> 02:32:31,870
Thank you for watching.

2060
02:32:31,898 --> 02:32:44,898
I was wondering if the first cicada to start crying is the last one to stop.

2061
02:32:44,898 --> 02:32:47,898
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

2062
02:32:48,368 --> 02:32:53,368
You asked me out of the blue.

2063
02:32:54,368 --> 02:33:00,368
I don't know what you meant by that.

2064
02:33:00,368 --> 02:33:06,368
I'm sure it didn't mean anything.

2065
02:33:08,800 --> 02:33:14,800
You were afraid to be silent.

2066
02:33:14,800 --> 02:33:20,800
What's important to you.

2067
02:33:20,800 --> 02:33:25,800
It's different for everyone.

2068
02:33:25,800 --> 02:33:31,800
I thought it was the same for everyone.

2069
02:33:31,800 --> 02:33:33,800
Immaturity, youth...

2070
02:33:33,800 --> 02:33:37,800
It's a pain in the ass, isn't it?

2071
02:33:37,800 --> 02:33:42,800
I've just realized that silence...

2072
02:33:42,800 --> 02:33:50,800
If it's love between us, I won't force you to let go.

2073
02:33:50,800 --> 02:33:55,800
Now I'm just looking out at the ocean

2074
02:33:55,800 --> 02:34:01,800
I'll wait till the sun goes down

2075
02:34:01,800 --> 02:34:06,800
Our clumsy goodbye

2076
02:34:06,800 --> 02:34:12,800
I can't put it into words

2077
02:34:12,800 --> 02:34:18,800
Until it's all dark

2078
02:34:18,800 --> 02:34:28,800
I just want to hold her by the shoulders and stay like this.

2079
02:34:29,184 --> 02:34:36,184
I have to say something. I have to carry on.

2080
02:34:36,184 --> 02:34:45,184
Maybe that's what you're thinking.

2081
02:34:47,802 --> 02:34:53,362
It's heartbreaking.

2082
02:34:53,362 --> 02:34:59,762
I just opened a Coke soda.

2083
02:34:59,762 --> 02:35:04,842
You're mumbling something.

2084
02:35:04,842 --> 02:35:10,282
Why don't we just tell each other the truth?

2085
02:35:10,282 --> 02:35:12,882
You know, pride and stubbornness...

2086
02:35:12,882 --> 02:35:15,762
It's just a distraction for the two of you.

2087
02:35:16,762 --> 02:35:21,962
So, what are you gonna do? Memories.

2088
02:35:21,962 --> 02:35:25,722
With memories.

2089
02:35:25,722 --> 02:35:29,522
I'd rather just sit here

2090
02:35:29,522 --> 02:35:34,602
I'd rather listen to the sound of the waves.

2091
02:35:34,602 --> 02:35:39,922
It's a calming way to say goodbye

2092
02:35:39,922 --> 02:35:45,882
Like I can't hold the tenderness in my heart

2093
02:35:45,882 --> 02:35:52,002
I slowly close my eyelids

2094
02:35:52,002 --> 02:35:57,922
When the first star is shining

2095
02:35:57,922 --> 02:36:07,002
I wonder if there will be no one by my side

2096
02:36:22,682 --> 02:36:27,682
When all the sounds of the world are gone and silence reigns

2097
02:36:27,682 --> 02:36:31,682
I wonder if I won't be able to feel joy or sadness

2098
02:36:31,682 --> 02:36:36,682
If that's the case, be brave

2099
02:36:36,682 --> 02:36:43,682
I'll look you in the eye and talk to you

2100
02:36:43,682 --> 02:36:47,682
Even if it's goodbye

2101
02:36:51,856 --> 02:37:01,356
If silence is our love, I won't force you to let goIf silence is our love, I won't force you to let go 

2102
02:37:01,356 --> 02:37:11,356
Now we'll just watch the sea and wait till the sun goes down

2103
02:37:11,356 --> 02:37:16,856
Our clumsy goodbye

2104
02:37:16,856 --> 02:37:23,856
I can't put it into words

2105
02:37:24,080 --> 02:37:28,580
Until it's all dark

2106
02:37:28,580 --> 02:37:33,080
I'll hold your shoulder

2107
02:37:33,080 --> 02:37:39,080
I just want to stay like this.

2108
02:37:49,594 --> 02:37:58,234
Thank you very much.

2109
02:37:58,234 --> 02:38:04,554
I lost my breath in the middle of the song. How was it, ladies and gentlemen?

2110
02:38:05,154 --> 02:38:08,634
Thank you.

2111
02:38:08,634 --> 02:38:15,434
I was so close at the beginning.

2112
02:38:15,834 --> 02:38:24,034
Well, they said we have two minutes. What? Hodley's?

2113
02:38:24,034 --> 02:38:27,954
What is it, Mr. Hodgley?

2114
02:38:28,194 --> 02:38:36,394
Oh, I see. I see. Thank you very much. Surely after this. It's almost over, guys. Thank you very much.

2115
02:38:36,394 --> 02:38:44,384
I know that I was quite nervous and had a lot going on for the first time, but it was really a lot of fun all in all.

2116
02:38:44,384 --> 02:38:49,584
I think we all had a lot of fun, and I would be very happy if we could do it again.

2117
02:38:49,584 --> 02:38:51,264
Thank you very much.

2118
02:38:51,264 --> 02:38:56,824
I hope to see you all again.

2119
02:38:56,824 --> 02:38:59,824
See you again in my dreams.

2120
02:38:59,824 --> 02:39:04,744
Bye-bye, and thank you very much. To everyone who really listened to the end.

2121
02:39:04,744 --> 02:39:07,464
See you soon!

